{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"About Rohinī: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja45'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 45 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Atthakāmavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Wanting to Help </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>5. Rohiṇijātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>About Rohinī: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Seyyo amitto medhāvī, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Better is an intelligent foe </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Yañce bālānukampako; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>than a foolish sympathizer. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Passa rohiṇikaṁ jammiṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>See that wretched Rohinī, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Mātaraṁ hantvāna socatī”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>grieving after killing her mother. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Rohiṇijātakaṁ pañcamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
